hint.ironagearchitecture.wall.post=Shape three matching post panels into a wall pattern.
hint.ironagearchitecture.wall.patterns=Row: rails; column: studs; diagonal: braces; L: corners.
hint.ironagearchitecture.wall.swap=Craft alone to swap the paired pattern.
hint.ironagearchitecture.wall.reset=Three matching pieces in a row return post panels.
hint.ironagearchitecture.wall.corner=Two shaped corners side by side recover short end posts.
hint.ironagearchitecture.wall.infill=Full infill + four matching planks makes four post panels.
hint.ironagearchitecture.cut=Cut a vertical pair; rejoin a horizontal pair.
hint.ironagearchitecture.wash=Limewash singly, or eight pieces around bone meal.
hint.ironagearchitecture.floor.brackets=Full floor + one stick makes two matching brackets.
hint.ironagearchitecture.floor.full=Two full floors vertically make four half floors.
hint.ironagearchitecture.floor.quarter=Two quarter floors side by side make one half floor.
hint.ironagearchitecture.floor.l=Craft alone to recover three quarter floors.
hint.ironagearchitecture.bracket.reach=One full bracket makes two halves; two halves rejoin.
hint.ironagearchitecture.roof.ridge=Cut two slopes vertically for four ridge caps.
hint.ironagearchitecture.roof.slope=Two ridge caps side by side make one roof slope.
hint.ironagearchitecture.clay.fascia=Place facing uphill for a timber edge along the low side.
hint.ironagearchitecture.clay.verge=Face uphill and click the left or right half that projects past the gable.
hint.ironagearchitecture.clay.ridge_end=Look along the ridge from outside to finish its exposed end.
hint.ironagearchitecture.clay.swap=Craft alone to swap a clay slope and a full hanging tile panel.
hint.ironagearchitecture.clay.place=Match the neighbouring wall half, or sneak to choose it yourself.
hint.ironagearchitecture.cob=Craft alone to make plain wattle and daub.
hint.ironagearchitecture.slab=Two slabs side by side recover one cob.
hint.ironagearchitecture.wall.short=Two short walls side by side make one thin wall.
hint.ironagearchitecture.stair=Four stairs in a square recover three cob.
