hint.ironagearchitecture.pipe.offset.3=Place beside the outer elbow, one cell closer to the wall.
hint.ironagearchitecture.pipe.cycle=Craft alone to switch to the next offset shape.
hint.ironagearchitecture.pipe.shoe=Craft a downpipe alone. Fit beneath the last pipe to let rain spill out above the ground.
hint.ironagearchitecture.window.use=Right-click to open the casement; redstone operates the whole column.
hint.ironagearchitecture.window.place=Stack to share a hinge; sneak to choose a different alignment.
